# 歯車 (docs/tessronos/13-gpu.md 13.6), for tools/ui_run.py on a build with make GL=1:
# the program object opened, the gears drawn by softpipe in a window of their
# own, two pictures some seconds apart (the gears turned between them), the
# frames counted on the console; then the window made larger by its corner,
# and the frame drawn at the new size
open 01a0d8c4-52e0-7a41-9b52-c6d7e8f9a0b1
expect glgears: softpipe
wait 3000
win 歯車
shot glgears_1
wait 2500
shot glgears_2
expect fps
drag 457 405 640 560
wait 3000
win 歯車
shot glgears_resized
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
